{
 "about": "What CI runs for which changed paths, mirrored from .github/workflows/*.yml for tools/ci/preflight.py (#759). Each check: id, title, paths (repo globs; ** spans folders) and exclude, the command and its cwd (placeholders {root}, {base} = merge base, {tmp} = run folder, per_match groups), env, needs (python version/exact/modules/dists/browser, node_deps, browser, os, commands, after), engines (CI's browser matrix), cost (fast | slow, with cost_note), ci_only (the reason a step exists only in CI; reported, never run, not in the verdict), timeout (seconds), needs.node_heap_mb, subset (runs part of a CI step), and mirrors: the workflow, job and exact CI command it stands for (in the entry's cwd unless the mirror names one). ci_node_major is the Node major CI's setup-node pins. per_match groups must be plain character classes; values are shell-quoted. tests/repo/ci/test_ci_checks.py fails when a pull-request workflow runs a check command that no entry mirrors, or an entry mirrors one that no longer exists.",
 "ci_node_major": "22",
